1
00:00:03,837 --> 00:00:07,337
-This is just a minor setback.
-No, it's not, okay?

2
00:00:07,508 --> 00:00:08,848
I've been out here for,
like, ten years.

3
00:00:09,009 --> 00:00:12,049
-I have nothing to show for it.
-Well, you have me.

4
00:00:14,314 --> 00:00:15,724
I do have you.

5
00:00:16,750 --> 00:00:18,390
Mmm.

6
00:00:22,256 --> 00:00:24,096
Leonard Hofstadter,

7
00:00:24,258 --> 00:00:25,858
will you marry me?

8
00:00:27,060 --> 00:00:28,700
(Amy:)Um...

9
00:00:31,031 --> 00:00:33,371
Did you seriously just say...umm?

10
00:00:35,002 --> 00:00:37,112
(Sheldon:)-It's an outrage.
-I know.

11
00:00:37,271 --> 00:00:39,441
(Sheldon:)The university, they think
they can do whatever they want.

12
00:00:39,606 --> 00:00:41,106
(Sheldon:)We just have to sit
there and take it.

13
00:00:41,275 --> 00:00:42,445
(Leonard:)You need to let it go, Sheldon.

14
00:00:42,609 --> 00:00:45,279
(Sheldon:)You work tirelessly for someone
and this is what you get.

15
00:00:45,445 --> 00:00:49,255
Oh, my God! They're just making
you use your vacation days!

16
00:00:50,951 --> 00:00:52,261
(Sheldon:)But I don't want a vacation.

17
00:00:52,419 --> 00:00:55,229
(Leonard:)Okay, listen, I don't mean to
diminish what you're going through,

18
00:00:55,389 --> 00:00:57,129
(Leonard:)but I'm a little
distracted right now.

19
00:00:57,291 --> 00:00:58,961
(Sheldon:)Oh, this again?

20
00:00:59,126 --> 00:01:01,436
(Sheldon:)So, Penny proposed,
you didn't say yes,

